===Noun===
{{en-noun|microvilli}}

# Any of many fingerlike extensions on the surfaces of many cells, consisting of the [[protein]]s [[actin]], [[fimbrin]], and [[villin]].
That greatly increase the cells surface area for absoption so that the process occurs more quickly.

